{"t": "15:01:25", "argv": ["submit", "--note", "Killed 75 memorization-like neurons (top-frequency energy fraction <0.2 across fc1-a, fc1-b, fc2 rfft) by setting their fc1.bias to -10 (+optimizer reset on those biases); kept 53 neurons that are mostly single-frequency Fourier features. Trials (1000 steps): kill<0.15 -> held-out 19%, kill<0.2 -> 25% (train 92%), kill<0.3 -> 26% but train only 70% (capacity-limited). Chose <0.2. Killed neurons are permanently dead; later rounds should not expect them back.", "--predict-next", "0.85", "--predict-end", "0.97"], "result": "submitted, changed 75", "ok": true}
